  "statement": "Given a string `s`, you can transform every letter individually to be lowercase or uppercase to create another string.\n\nReturn _a list of all possible strings we could create_. Return the output in **any order**.\n\n**Example 1:**\n\n```\nInput: s = \"a1b2\"\nOutput: [\"a1b2\",\"a1B2\",\"A1b2\",\"A1B2\"]\n```\n\n**Example 2:**\n\n```\nInput: s = \"3z4\"\nOutput: [\"3z4\",\"3Z4\"]\n```\n\n**Constraints:**\n\n*   `1 <= s.length <= 12`\n*   `s` consists of lowercase English letters, uppercase English letters, and digits.",
